CORE
signed_properties.c
--pointer-check --strict-static-array --show-properties
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^Property read_exact_signed.pointer_dereference.1:$
^  \(signed __CPROVER_bitvector\[65\]\)\(signed long int\)i >= 0 && !\(\(signed __CPROVER_bitvector\[65\]\)\(signed long int\)i >= 4\)$
--
^Property read_exact_signed.pointer_dereference.[2-9][0-9]*:$
^warning: ignoring
--
Checks that exact-size mode emits a direct lower-and-upper index range for a
signed dynamic index.
